{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.poster.avif?t=1773974288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.webm?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.mp4?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blooming Cards</strong> is a cozy card-based life sim where card stacking meets shopkeeping and heartfelt storytelling. Inspired by <i>Stacklands</i> and <i>Animal Crossing</i>, it blends relaxing gameplay with light management, card stacking and narrative choices that grow alongside your flower shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack cards to plant seeds, water sprouts, and craft beautiful blooms that bring color to your garden and joy to your customers. Combine tools, soil, and sunlight to discover new plants, unlock upgrades, and shape your space exactly how you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/6d716ec332546f589103a5cdc2c0204b.poster.avif?t=1773974288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/6d716ec332546f589103a5cdc2c0204b.webm?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/6d716ec332546f589103a5cdc2c0204b.mp4?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tending your shop isn\u2019t just about flowers\u2014it\u2019s about people. As your business blossoms, you\u2019ll meet charming regulars, travelers, and friends, each carrying a story of their own. Through small conversations and dialogue choices, you\u2019ll uncover their struggles, their hopes, and maybe even your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey also traces the bond with your parents, revealing how your choices balance personal dreams and family expectations. Grow your garden and your relationships, and discover how your story blooms\u2014with endings that reflect the path you\u2019ve chosen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613680?t=1773974288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613680?t=1773974288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/82b8d358f64c0bfec3c61b112a87b32937a399d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773974288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/82b8d358f64c0bfec3c61b112a87b32937a399d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773974288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.poster.avif?t=1773974288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.webm?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613680/extras/8689c664b925eb149b977d82d77b528f.mp4?t=1773974288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></